        "Description": "On Valentine&apos;s Day, Munga ended his live stream. In the moment after blinked, Munga found himself transported to Dartmoor in WoA.\r\r&quot;If you want to return to the real world, you must complete 3 targets,&quot; said Diana.\r\rTarget No.1 – Create two explosions to cause chaos\r\rTarget No.2 – Find Phinas Whitmer, by disguising yourself as him, you can deceive the game system\r\rTarget No.3 – Find Otto Lee, the core program of the Dartmoor map. Only by eliminating him can you leave the game world\r\r&quot;Good luck.&quot;",
